      "writtenOn": "2019-02-08T09:10:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Idea was to be consistent with the other heci client implementations, and allow for bidirectional messaging and report status/error. You are right, currently there is only 1 command for host2ish and we are not returning error status at that layer from FW. \n\nWould it still make sense to still keep the command/status to allow for future extensions? ish2host events / mkbp ?",
